{
    "title": "family locator - Locator 24",
    "description": "The family locator uses the latest technology, so you will be able to see the location of your phone based on GPS and the cellular network.\r\n\r\nWith the phone locator you will see the location of your children right now. With your child's location history, you'll see where they were before\r\n\r\nFamily Locator is very easy to use, just follow three simple steps:\r\n\r\n1. After registration, click the \"+\" button and select Add child.\r\n\r\n2. Then click \"\u2713\" to generate a unique code.\r\n\r\n3. Your child should download the apps and register using this code.\r\n\r\nWith Family Locator you will also be able to:\r\n\r\n- view your child's location history\r\n\r\n- receive notifications when your child enters or leaves the designated place (GPS must be turned on)\r\n\r\n- designate a route to the child's chosen location\r\n\r\n- send an alert in case of emergency\r\n\r\n- talk to children at no cost\r\n\r\n- find my phone (if you lose your phone)\r\n\r\nPhone tracker will notify you when:\r\n\r\n- the kids phone enters or leaves the designated place\r\n\r\n- the kids phone will lose access to the Internet\r\n\r\n- the kids phone will lose access to the location\r\n\r\n- the kids phone will have less than 15% battery\r\n\r\n- the kids phone exceeds the set speed\r\n\r\n- the kids location will not be accurate\r\n\r\n- you will have unread messages\r\n\r\nOur phone tracker has all these features for free.\r\n\r\nThe find my phone function can be used for each added family member.\r\n\r\nIf you want to find your kids on the map, just select them from the list. You can also find your child on the satellite map, which is available in the phone locator application settings.\r\n\r\nRemember, for the family locator to work properly, your phone's location must be turned on so that your phone can use GPS technology. If your phone tracker cannot receive a GPS signal, phone locator will use your phone's location based on the less accurate cellular network.\r\n\r\nThanks to the phone locator application, you will be able to see the location of your children, which will allow you to ensure their safety. Find your child quickly with a selection of map types. You can browse unlimited kids locations in the app.\r\n\r\nDownload our phone tracker now and protect your loved ones.\r\n\r\nRemember, to use the find my phone function, you must have location access turned on\r\n\r\nImportant information:\r\nfamily locator cannot be installed on a child's mobile phone without his or her knowledge. Remember not to share your family's location with anyone you don't know. Your child's location will only be available to you. If you want your child's location to be displayed correctly, please follow all necessary instructions in the app (Turn on GPS location). Phone tracker runs in the background even when the app is closed. Also remember to allow notifications, because only then will the phone locator be able to notify you of danger. If your child's location is not working properly, you can contact us to improve the app",
    "descriptionHTML": "The family locator uses the latest technology, so you will be able to see the location of your phone based on GPS and the cellular network.<br><br>With the phone locator you will see the location of your children right now. With your child&#39;s location history, you&#39;ll see where they were before<br><br>Family Locator is very easy to use, just follow three simple steps:<br><br>1. After registration, click the &quot;+&quot; button and select Add child.<br><br>2. Then click &quot;\u2713&quot; to generate a unique code.<br><br>3. Your child should download the apps and register using this code.<br><br>With Family Locator you will also be able to:<br><br>- view your child&#39;s location history<br><br>- receive notifications when your child enters or leaves the designated place (GPS must be turned on)<br><br>- designate a route to the child&#39;s chosen location<br><br>- send an alert in case of emergency<br><br>- talk to children at no cost<br><br>- find my phone (if you lose your phone)<br><br>Phone tracker will notify you when:<br><br>- the kids phone enters or leaves the designated place<br><br>- the kids phone will lose access to the Internet<br><br>- the kids phone will lose access to the location<br><br>- the kids phone will have less than 15% battery<br><br>- the kids phone exceeds the set speed<br><br>- the kids location will not be accurate<br><br>- you will have unread messages<br><br>Our phone tracker has all these features for free.<br><br>The find my phone function can be used for each added family member.<br><br>If you want to find your kids on the map, just select them from the list. You can also find your child on the satellite map, which is available in the phone locator application settings.<br><br>Remember, for the family locator to work properly, your phone&#39;s location must be turned on so that your phone can use GPS technology. If your phone tracker cannot receive a GPS signal, phone locator will use your phone&#39;s location based on the less accurate cellular network.<br><br>Thanks to the phone locator application, you will be able to see the location of your children, which will allow you to ensure their safety. Find your child quickly with a selection of map types. You can browse unlimited kids locations in the app.<br><br>Download our phone tracker now and protect your loved ones.<br><br>Remember, to use the find my phone function, you must have location access turned on<br><br>Important information:<br>family locator cannot be installed on a child&#39;s mobile phone without his or her knowledge. Remember not to share your family&#39;s location with anyone you don&#39;t know. Your child&#39;s location will only be available to you. If you want your child&#39;s location to be displayed correctly, please follow all necessary instructions in the app (Turn on GPS location). Phone tracker runs in the background even when the app is closed. Also remember to allow notifications, because only then will the phone locator be able to notify you of danger. If your child&#39;s location is not working properly, you can contact us to improve the app",
